Decorators 
######################

Decorators in TypeScript are a feature that lets you modify the behavior of classes, methods, properties, or parameters

Their are 4 types of decorators
--------------------------------
    1. class decorator
    2. property decorator
    3. method decorator
    4. parameter decorator


