| ------------ | ------------------------- | -------------- |
| Loop         | `*ngFor`                  | `@for`         |
| If condition | `*ngIf`                   | `@if`          |
| Else         | `else` with `ng-template` | `@else`        |
| Switch       | `*ngSwitch`               | `@switch`      |
| Case         | `*ngSwitchCase`           | `@case`        |
| Default      | `*ngSwitchDefault`        | `@default`     |
| Empty loop   | —                         | `@empty`       |
